# Git Workflow Rules
- NEVER merge directly to `main` or `master`.
- NEVER execute `git merge`, `gh pr merge`, or enable direct auto-merges.
- Always create a feature branch (`feat/...`, `fix/...`).
- Push branch, open PR, provide PR link to user, and wait for user approval.
